00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:29.320
Meanwhile, Ireland's parliament has acted on abortion access rules. Ireland's doll approved legislation

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:35.340
removing the three-day waiting period previously required before medication abortion in early pregnancy.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:41.240
The change follows arguments that the original role created an unnecessary barrier.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:47.420
The bill now moves to committee before becoming law. Supporters of the change describe the waiting

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:53.760
period as an obstacle that disproportionately affected people in rural areas or with limited

00:02:53.760 --> 00:03:00.440
scheduling flexibility. Opponents maintain that the original provision provided time for reflection

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:07.160
and was part of the compromise that passed the 2018 referendum. Campaigners who backed repeal

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:13.320
of the eighth amendment argue that removing the wait simply eliminates a procedural hurdle without

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:19.460
changing eligibility criteria. Groups that supported retaining the wait contend that the original

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:24.920
design already represented a carefully negotiated middle ground between access and caution.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:31.500
What timeline is expected for the bill to reach final passage? Next, the Swiss National Bank has kept

